SchildiChat Revenge is a Matrix client initially created for Desktop, but now available on Android too.
This is the first SchildiChat client that is not an Element fork.

<div class="note">

**NOTE**: This client is in it's beta phase, and may still miss features here and there.  
If you're looking for the no-longer maintained SchildiChat Desktop client based on Element Web, you can find it [here](/legacy/desktop).
The current recommendation for Android would be [SchildiChat Next](/next) based on Element&nbsp;X.

</div>

**Discussion**: [#revenge:schildi.chat](https://matrix.to/#/#revenge:schildi.chat)  
**Releases & desktop downloads**: [GitHub]({{github_src_link}}/releases)  
**Android builds**: [SpiritCroc F-Droid repo]({{fdroid_download_link}})


